{{Item|Spider Essence}} is an [[Essence]]. It is primarily used in the {{Zone|spider's den}}.

== Obtaining ==
{{Item|Spider Essence}} can be be obtained in {{Zone|arachne's burrow}} and the [[Catacombs]] in multiple ways:
* [[Salvaging#Spider|Salvaging]] certain items and items upgraded with {{Item|Spider Essence}}.
* Killing {{MobSprite|Arachne}} in {{Zone|arachne's burrow}}.
* [[Dungeon Secrets|Dungeon Secret Chests]]
* Trading with {{NPCSprite|Spider Tamer}} visitor in {{Zone|The Garden}}.
